{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36171","headline":"题慈溪张丞壁 · 方干","name":"题慈溪张丞壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因君贰邑蓝溪上，遣我维舟红叶时。\n共向乡中非半面，俱惊鬓里有新丝。\n竚看孤洁成三考，应笑愚疎舍一枝。\n貌似故人心尚喜，相逢况是旧相知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}